{"title":"2003 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 5","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solutions\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solutions</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2.2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Solution_3\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2.3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 3</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#Solution_4\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2.4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 4</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-7\"><a href=\"#See_Also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See Also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2003_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/6/a/96ab646de7704969b91c76a214126b45f2b07b25.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$d$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/3/a/a3a59bb1293ee3f6dec19de4019a7178874219ae.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$e$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"10\" /> denote the solutions of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/1/9/6194e5f19233e921a6f0cbb5de515bbfc0d46c60.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2x^{2}+3x-5=0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"132\" height=\"16\" />. What is the value of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/d/8/9d8af9b498a9fb57b84e286b1ec324981ae70939.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(d-1)(e-1)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"107\" height=\"18\" />? \n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/3/4/834b170c4716766d1f8785b20bac88f8a7ea9150.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\mathrm{(A) \\ } -\\frac{5}{2}\\qquad \\mathrm{(B) \\ } 0\\qquad \\mathrm{(C) \\ } 3\\qquad \\mathrm{(D) \\ } 5\\qquad \\mathrm{(E) \\ } 6$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"368\" height=\"37\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solutions\">Solutions</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2003_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solutions\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2003_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<p>Using factoring: \n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/1/9/6194e5f19233e921a6f0cbb5de515bbfc0d46c60.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2x^{2}+3x-5=0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"132\" height=\"16\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/e/8/2e816e31114bfe52cce0bf2dc361ef7d6b0e5da6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(2x+5)(x-1)=0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"153\" height=\"18\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/1/7/b17a14c1b6b680f212dcce7c206bb973956b308f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x = -\\frac{5}{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"60\" height=\"37\" /> or <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/c/5/4c52e02a35db152495396584bfeae1d0599cd753.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x=1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"46\" height=\"14\" /> \n</p><p>So <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/6/a/96ab646de7704969b91c76a214126b45f2b07b25.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$d$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/3/a/a3a59bb1293ee3f6dec19de4019a7178874219ae.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$e$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"10\" /> are <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/0/3/303068584cec18d1ced7af8ff82c262ec91bac48.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$-\\frac{5}{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"25\" height=\"37\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/e/dce34f4dfb2406144304ad0d6106c5382ddd1446.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />. \n</p><p>Therefore the answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/3/d/43dd3afdc8da794a257ed10f39bcbf01ac0ad8f2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\left(-\\frac{5}{2}-1\\right)(1-1)=\\left(-\\frac{7}{2}\\right)(0)=\\boxed{\\mathrm{(B)}\\ 0}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -17px\" width=\"323\" height=\"43\" />\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2003_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<p>We can use the sum and product of a quadratic (a.k.a Vieta):\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/3/b/03b879da222f2ecfadef0952c652e80dd87a90a9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(d-1)(e-1)=de-(d+e)+1 \\implies\\text{product}-\\text{sum}+1 \\implies \\dfrac{c}{a}-\\left(-\\dfrac{b}{a}\\right)+1 \\implies \\dfrac{b+c}{a}+1= \\dfrac{5}{-5}+1=\\boxed{\\mathrm{(B)}\\ 0}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -17px\" width=\"901\" height=\"43\" />\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_3\">Solution 3</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2003_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 3\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<p>By inspection, we quickly note that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/c/5/4c52e02a35db152495396584bfeae1d0599cd753.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x=1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"46\" height=\"14\" /> is a solution to the equation, therefore the answer is\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/5/2/d5274ad034bcd9d74d445c9c7bd86247902d5ef4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(d-1)(e-1)=(1-1)(e-1)=\\boxed{\\mathrm{(B)}\\ 0}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"319\" height=\"29\" />\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_4\">Solution 4</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2003_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;section=6\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 4\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<p>The form <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/d/8/9d8af9b498a9fb57b84e286b1ec324981ae70939.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(d-1)(e-1)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"107\" height=\"18\" /> resembles the factored form for the quadratic, namely <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/c/7/8c77f814c63df809f9828664bb0f381a385ff42a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(x-d)(x-e)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"110\" height=\"18\" /> based on the information given. Note putting in 1 for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> in the that quadratic immediately yields the desired expression. Thus, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/2/1/b218861c02a3f6438a9ebb09cb27dfb3fa12f80d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2(1)^2+3(1)-5 = \\boxed{\\mathrm{(B)}\\ 0}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"205\" height=\"32\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2003_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;section=7\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2003_AMC_10A\" title=\"2003 AMC 10A\">2003 AMC 10A</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2003_AMC_10A_Problems\" title=\"2003 AMC 10A Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2003_AMC_10A_Answer_Key\" title=\"2003 AMC 10A Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/community/c13\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2003_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_4\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2003 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 4\">Problem 4</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2003_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_6\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2003 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 6\">Problem 6</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2003_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_1\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2003 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2003_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_2\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2003 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2003_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_3\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2003 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2003_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_4\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2003 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2003_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_6\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2003 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2003_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_7\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2003 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2003_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_8\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2003 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 8\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2003_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_9\" title=\"2003 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 9\">9</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2003_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_10\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2003 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 10\">10</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2003_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_11\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2003 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 11\">11</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2003_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_12\" title=\"2003 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 12\">12</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2003_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_13\" title=\"2003 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 13\">13</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2003_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_14\" title=\"2003 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 14\">14</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2003_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_15\" title=\"2003 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 15\">15</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2003_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_16\" title=\"2003 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 16\">16</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2003_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_17\" title=\"2003 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 17\">17</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2003_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_18\" title=\"2003 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 18\">18</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2003_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_19\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2003 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 19\">19</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2003_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_20\" title=\"2003 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 20\">20</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2003_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_21\" title=\"2003 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 21\">21</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2003_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_22\" title=\"2003 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 22\">22</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2003_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_23\" title=\"2003 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 23\">23</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2003_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_24\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2003 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 24\">24</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2003_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_25\" title=\"2003 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 25\">25</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=AMC_10_Problems_and_Solutions\" title=\"AMC 10 Problems and Solutions\"> All AMC 10 Problems and Solutions</a></b>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<div class=\"print\">\n<div style=\"display:flex;width:100%;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center\">\n<div>\n<p><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=File:AMC_Logo.png\" 